OL,3,AEarnings limit of up to #140K for
OL,4,Afirst-time buyers loan scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is expected to allow
OL,7,Fhouseholds earning up to #110,000 to
OL,8,Fapply for its new loan scheme to help
OL,9,Ffirst-time buyers in England.
OL,11,FAs first reported by The Times, a
OL,12,Fhigher earnings limit of #140,000 is
OL,13,Fexpected to apply to those purchasing
OL,14,Fproperties in London.
OL,16,FThe Your First Home scheme will offer
OL,17,Fgovernment-backed equity loans worth
OL,18,F20% of new-build properties purchased
OL,19,Ffrom participating developers.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
